sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Brauzer
  participant I as authInterceptor
  participant API as API
  participant DB as sessions jadvali
  B->>I: Himoyalangan so‘rov
  I->>API: Authorization: Bearer JWT (15 daqiqa)
  alt Token amal qiladi
    API-->>B: 200 OK
  else Muddati o‘tgan
    API-->>I: 401 Unauthorized
    I->>API: POST /api/auth/refresh (HttpOnly cookie)
    API->>DB: HMAC xesh bo‘yicha sessiyani topish
    API->>DB: Yangi refresh token xeshi (rotatsiya), LastActiveAt
    API-->>I: Yangi JWT va yangi cookie (30 kun)
    I->>API: Asl so‘rovni qayta yuborish
    API-->>B: 200 OK
  end
  Note over B,DB: Chiqish yoki sessiyani yakunlash: RevokedAt belgilanadi, cookie o‘chiriladi
